1
00:00:47,422 --> 00:00:48,548
Please, Mikoy,

2
00:00:48,631 --> 00:00:50,800
don't do something
you'll regret in the end.

3
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:53,261
Let's give justice to Dad Mario's death,

4
00:00:53,344 --> 00:00:54,596
but in the right way.

5
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:55,722
Because I'm sure

6
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:57,599
that's what he would have wanted too.

7
00:01:01,394 --> 00:01:05,106
But it's either
you work for me or against me.

8
00:01:16,785 --> 00:01:18,453
Who are those eager beavers?

9
00:01:18,536 --> 00:01:20,872
This is a black ops operation,

10
00:01:20,955 --> 00:01:22,832
so they're working outside their rules.

11
00:01:22,916 --> 00:01:23,875
I'm just worried and afraid

12
00:01:23,958 --> 00:01:26,336
that if they somehow
get Mikoy on their side…

13
00:01:26,419 --> 00:01:31,007
Chiara specifically instructed us
that no one should touch Mikoy.

14
00:01:38,389 --> 00:01:40,225
We're also tired of slow justice.

15
00:01:58,910 --> 00:02:00,954
Based on our own investigation,

16
00:02:01,454 --> 00:02:02,747
we have reason to believe

17
00:02:02,831 --> 00:02:07,877
that everything Chiara did to help GAGO
was part of her grand plan.

18
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:12,006
No offense, Mikoy,

19
00:02:12,715 --> 00:02:14,968
but heaven and earth
were never meant to be together.

20
00:02:19,305 --> 00:02:21,516
It seems Chiara has long planned to become

21
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:23,101
the queen of the Concordat.

22
00:02:23,685 --> 00:02:28,189
To take over and run the United Nations
of syndicates herself.

23
00:02:32,694 --> 00:02:33,945
That's why she couldn't kill me.

24
00:02:34,696 --> 00:02:36,906
Even though she knew
I was an asset for the agency.

25
00:02:38,741 --> 00:02:42,537
You know what I hate most of all?

26
00:02:43,246 --> 00:02:45,874
<i>Being lied to.</i>

27
00:02:45,957 --> 00:02:47,834
You're betraying me, aren't you?

28
00:03:13,484 --> 00:03:14,819
<i>And when La Morte Bianca died,</i>

29
00:03:16,029 --> 00:03:17,697
<i>the obstacle to her ambitions was gone.</i>

30
00:03:24,787 --> 00:03:27,957
Marrying me was all just a setup

31
00:03:28,041 --> 00:03:29,918
for her coronation.

32
00:03:30,835 --> 00:03:32,337
Unfortunately,

33
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:34,714
Father Mario found out
about all her plans.

34
00:03:43,973 --> 00:03:45,308
<i>Wherever she is now,</i>

35
00:03:46,684 --> 00:03:48,686
<i>she's probably at the height of her power,</i>

36
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:50,688
<i>fulfilling her ambitions.</i>

37
00:03:51,981 --> 00:03:53,066
<i>She already has everything she wants.</i>

38
00:04:29,644 --> 00:04:31,312
Are you mad at me?

39
00:04:36,943 --> 00:04:39,070
This is the life we have.

40
00:04:39,612 --> 00:04:42,031
This is the life that comes with power.

41
00:04:45,493 --> 00:04:49,289
In life, my child, we make hard choices.

42
00:04:55,545 --> 00:04:56,713
Isn't there any other choice, Mom?

43
00:05:03,177 --> 00:05:04,470
You're still young.

44
00:05:08,474 --> 00:05:09,851
Explain it to me.

45
00:05:10,435 --> 00:05:12,228
Why does anyone else have to get hurt?

46
00:05:12,812 --> 00:05:14,814
Why does someone
have to sacrifice their life

47
00:05:14,897 --> 00:05:16,399
just for us?

48
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,197
When Chiara became
the queen of the Concordat,

49
00:05:23,281 --> 00:05:24,699
many were pleased.

50
00:05:24,782 --> 00:05:26,617
Many showed their support,

51
00:05:26,701 --> 00:05:29,245
and the organization grew strong again.

52
00:05:29,746 --> 00:05:31,164
As of now,

53
00:05:31,247 --> 00:05:33,541
their operations are only in Europe.

54
00:05:33,624 --> 00:05:36,002
But sooner or later,
they'll reach the Philippines.

55
00:05:40,506 --> 00:05:42,341
And to prevent that from happening,

56
00:05:43,217 --> 00:05:44,927
we have to get to her first.

57
00:06:00,485 --> 00:06:02,653
Because he's the only one
who truly knows her.

58
00:06:04,322 --> 00:06:08,493
And only you can tell us
how to defeat her.

59
00:06:22,298 --> 00:06:24,967
You are asking the wrong question,
my child.

60
00:06:25,551 --> 00:06:27,512
Shouldn't you be asking,

61
00:06:27,595 --> 00:06:30,890
what if I were in that position?

62
00:06:30,973 --> 00:06:33,518
I cannot make a choice

63
00:06:33,601 --> 00:06:38,189
when we don't even have the right
to decide our own lives.

64
00:06:49,242 --> 00:06:52,328
Because we are no longer at the mercy

65
00:06:52,411 --> 00:06:54,122
of other people's decisions.

66
00:06:56,749 --> 00:06:58,334
We're already at the top.

67
00:07:01,170 --> 00:07:02,463
We have power.

68
00:07:06,801 --> 00:07:08,344
Up here,

69
00:07:08,928 --> 00:07:11,055
where the view is better.

70
00:07:14,517 --> 00:07:15,476
My child.

71
00:07:16,727 --> 00:07:18,312
Believe me.

72
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:22,525
This is better

73
00:07:22,608 --> 00:07:26,154
than being at the bottom
and getting stepped on.

74
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:46,424
Mikoy.

75
00:07:51,929 --> 00:07:53,514
Mikoy, there's no turning back.

76
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:55,391
No going back.

77
00:07:56,726 --> 00:07:58,686
We're talking about Chiara here.

78
00:07:59,437 --> 00:08:01,272
Are you sure about
what you're going to do?

79
00:08:02,482 --> 00:08:06,235
What I'm sure about
is getting justice for my father's death.

80
00:08:06,819 --> 00:08:07,653
Unfortunately,

81
00:08:08,321 --> 00:08:10,072
this is the only way.

82
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,867
But is this really what you want?

83
00:08:13,910 --> 00:08:14,994
Why?

84
00:08:15,703 --> 00:08:16,621
Do you think

85
00:08:17,538 --> 00:08:19,749
I want everything
that's happening to me, Alex?

86
00:08:22,710 --> 00:08:24,837
Yes, it's Chiara.

87
00:08:24,921 --> 00:08:26,339
But that's exactly what hurts.

88
00:08:26,923 --> 00:08:28,633
The person I still love

89
00:08:30,218 --> 00:08:32,136
is capable of doing all this.

90
00:08:40,895 --> 00:08:42,063
How many more people
will have to experience

91
00:08:42,146 --> 00:08:44,315
the same pain we went through, Alex?

92
00:08:49,153 --> 00:08:50,404
Enough, Alex.

93
00:08:52,365 --> 00:08:54,075
It's already too painful.

94
00:09:32,488 --> 00:09:35,199
<i>I know all of you are wondering</i>

95
00:09:35,283 --> 00:09:38,286
<i>if this relationship</i>
<i>that Mikoy entered is right.</i>

96
00:09:40,162 --> 00:09:42,248
<i>Because of the two different worlds</i>
<i>we live in.</i>

97
00:09:58,139 --> 00:10:00,641
<i>Sometimes those challenges</i>

98
00:10:01,350 --> 00:10:03,352
<i>come from enemies,</i>

99
00:10:05,396 --> 00:10:06,647
<i>fighting,</i>

100
00:10:08,149 --> 00:10:09,817
<i>and rivalry.</i>

101
00:10:17,325 --> 00:10:20,244
<i>No one will ever hurt Mikoy.</i>

102
00:10:42,933 --> 00:10:46,145
<i>For the first time in my life,</i>
<i>I felt fear.</i>

103
00:10:47,063 --> 00:10:49,148
<i>Turns out, it’s okay to have fear.</i>

104
00:10:49,899 --> 00:10:51,859
<i>It’s fine to have fears inside your heart</i>

105
00:10:52,735 --> 00:10:55,196
<i>because it means</i>
<i>there’s something inside of it,</i>

106
00:10:55,863 --> 00:10:59,241
<i>and I have people I’m afraid to lose.</i>

107
00:11:04,997 --> 00:11:07,833
<i>I am really grateful for accepting me.</i>

108
00:11:14,298 --> 00:11:15,716
<i>That’s why</i>

109
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:18,552
<i>I’m so excited</i>
<i>to spend the rest of my life</i>

110
00:11:18,636 --> 00:11:21,222
<i>with you and grow old with you.</i>

111
00:11:28,229 --> 00:11:29,480
<i>I'm sorry, my love.</i>

112
00:11:31,232 --> 00:11:34,568
<i>This is the only way I know</i>
<i>to protect you.</i>

113
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:38,989
<i>Because of all the sins I've committed,</i>

114
00:11:39,490 --> 00:11:42,159
<i>I have to pay for them on my own.</i>

115
00:11:42,827 --> 00:11:45,246
<i>You shouldn't have</i>
<i>to get dragged into this anymore.</i>

116
00:11:49,291 --> 00:11:51,669
Looks like things
are getting really serious.

117
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:53,671
You said it.

118
00:11:53,754 --> 00:11:57,091
It's like my punchlines
don't even work anymore.

119
00:11:57,174 --> 00:11:58,467
Hey.

120
00:11:58,551 --> 00:12:02,012
You two be careful.
A lot of things are changing.

121
00:12:02,638 --> 00:12:04,348
By the way, where's Sianong?

122
00:12:05,683 --> 00:12:06,642
Who knows?

123
00:12:07,476 --> 00:12:09,937
There he goes,
wandering around everywhere.

124
00:12:11,230 --> 00:12:12,481
He's the weird one.

125
00:12:13,566 --> 00:12:15,609
It seems like he's got a lot going on.

126
00:12:16,485 --> 00:12:18,070
What do you mean?

127
00:12:21,824 --> 00:12:22,783
I don't know.

128
00:12:23,826 --> 00:12:27,204
It feels like our relationship
is on the rocks too.

129
00:12:28,998 --> 00:12:29,832
So you're sitting on rocks?

130
00:12:31,250 --> 00:12:32,084
You idiot!

131
00:12:34,837 --> 00:12:36,922
Maybe he's going through something.

132
00:12:46,932 --> 00:12:48,726
You miss him.

133
00:12:48,809 --> 00:12:50,352
You miss him.

134
00:12:50,436 --> 00:12:51,937
You really miss him.

135
00:12:53,439 --> 00:12:55,399
What you want to do won't be easy.

136
00:13:00,070 --> 00:13:02,865
That's why I called you here

137
00:13:02,948 --> 00:13:04,158
because I know

138
00:13:04,241 --> 00:13:07,203
you're the only one who can do it.

139
00:13:19,048 --> 00:13:24,845
Or maybe Mikoy is the key
to bringing down the whole agency.

140
00:13:30,726 --> 00:13:32,853
And maybe they'll realize

141
00:13:33,354 --> 00:13:37,816
that fighting against
the powerful Concordat isn't worth it.

142
00:13:38,859 --> 00:13:41,195
Mikoy isn't some small-time asset anymore.

143
00:13:42,613 --> 00:13:44,573
He is very capable, especially now.

144
00:13:47,868 --> 00:13:50,663
I'm sure that had
a huge effect on his life.

145
00:13:51,247 --> 00:13:52,456
Exactly.

146
00:13:56,710 --> 00:14:00,839
Because if you combine that with grief

147
00:14:00,923 --> 00:14:04,635
and the will to bring justice
for his father's death,

148
00:14:05,511 --> 00:14:08,639
he becomes an unstoppable force.

149
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:13,310
What was that again?

150
00:14:14,770 --> 00:14:18,190
"When the bucket is full,
it’s time to draw from it."

151
00:14:55,728 --> 00:14:58,063
Looks like a serious conversation.

152
00:14:59,607 --> 00:15:00,941
Was it that intense?

153
00:15:05,946 --> 00:15:08,866
I almost believe that smile of yours.

154
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:16,165
You might deceive Mikoy and Chiara,

155
00:15:16,248 --> 00:15:17,249
but not me.

156
00:15:18,292 --> 00:15:19,501
When I realized

157
00:15:19,585 --> 00:15:21,503
you started to be a part
of the Pinagpalas,

158
00:15:21,587 --> 00:15:24,006
I already had my suspicions.

159
00:15:24,089 --> 00:15:28,260
So you don’t have to act,
and you don’t have to pretend

160
00:15:28,344 --> 00:15:31,597
because I know very well
what and who you are.

161
00:15:34,475 --> 00:15:36,435
You're indeed a GAGO.

162
00:15:38,729 --> 00:15:40,606
Mom always talks about you.

163
00:15:41,190 --> 00:15:42,733
About her card.

164
00:15:43,901 --> 00:15:44,818
Can you imagine?

165
00:15:45,444 --> 00:15:49,031
She has a spy in the agency.

166
00:15:50,324 --> 00:15:51,992
That’s why I told her

167
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:57,289
if you can betray your friends
and the people you treat as your family,

168
00:15:59,041 --> 00:16:02,920
most likely, you can also turn us in.

169
00:16:11,512 --> 00:16:13,138
I respect your mother,

170
00:16:13,889 --> 00:16:17,267
but I can’t extend
the same courtesy to you.

171
00:16:17,351 --> 00:16:18,602
Why don’t you try?

172
00:16:20,312 --> 00:16:24,692
So I can prove to Mom
that she might be wrong for trusting you.

173
00:16:26,235 --> 00:16:27,111
Sianong.

174
00:16:32,408 --> 00:16:33,909
How you can be so sure?

175
00:16:35,327 --> 00:16:39,248
Because Bro Mikoy has one thing
that you don’t have.

176
00:16:40,708 --> 00:16:41,542
What is it?

177
00:16:42,626 --> 00:16:44,461
He has a reason to live.

178
00:16:59,727 --> 00:17:02,604
<i>If you combine that with grip</i>

179
00:17:02,688 --> 00:17:05,858
<i>and the will to bring justice</i>
<i>for his father’s death,</i>

180
00:17:06,608 --> 00:17:09,153
<i>he becomes an unstoppable force.</i>

181
00:17:13,490 --> 00:17:16,952
<i>Because Bro Mikoy has one thing</i>
<i>that you don’t have.</i>

182
00:17:18,537 --> 00:17:20,372
<i>He has a reason to live.</i>

183
00:17:44,646 --> 00:17:45,689
You’re dead.

184
00:17:46,273 --> 00:17:47,107
Not yet!

185
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:50,152
If it’s Chiara you’re fighting with,

186
00:17:50,736 --> 00:17:52,154
you’re already dead.

187
00:17:55,866 --> 00:17:58,410
You are the person who has been
with Chiara the longest.

188
00:17:59,203 --> 00:18:01,413
You’re the only trainee she had.

189
00:18:02,372 --> 00:18:06,376
And you are the only person who knows her.

190
00:18:59,596 --> 00:19:01,640
We both know that when you
are facing each other,

191
00:19:02,224 --> 00:19:04,184
you'll need that kind of courage.

192
00:19:12,484 --> 00:19:14,361
Long live the Principale.

193
00:20:20,761 --> 00:20:23,347
They might recognize you
as their principale.

194
00:21:34,584 --> 00:21:36,503
What will you do, Chiara?

195
00:21:37,921 --> 00:21:40,132
Kill everyone who refuses to follow you?

196
00:21:46,972 --> 00:21:48,098
That would be exhausting.

197
00:21:55,147 --> 00:21:56,273
Child.

198
00:22:26,970 --> 00:22:27,971
Mikoy.

199
00:22:29,598 --> 00:22:31,308
We have new information.

200
00:22:50,243 --> 00:22:52,621
Just make sure there’s no evidence.

201
00:22:52,704 --> 00:22:56,583
Because if Chiara finds out
that we touch Mikoy…

202
00:22:56,666 --> 00:22:57,501
No one will know.

203
00:22:57,584 --> 00:22:58,877
End it well.

204
00:23:00,545 --> 00:23:02,339
Did you know about Sianong?

205
00:23:10,055 --> 00:23:11,640
And that’s what we’re worried about.

206
00:23:11,723 --> 00:23:12,390
Mama…

207
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:16,186
If she’s able to plant a spy in GAGO,

208
00:23:16,269 --> 00:23:20,398
it’s not possible for her to do the same
around you.

209
00:23:22,609 --> 00:23:24,402
You should not trust him.

210
00:23:24,486 --> 00:23:26,363
What about you? Do you trust him?

211
00:23:27,656 --> 00:23:28,782
You will finish it.

212
00:23:31,159 --> 00:23:32,410
My only son.

213
00:23:47,384 --> 00:23:48,343
Hey!
